[en.DECISION_CATEGORY_C08_COMMAND]
Joint Command

[en.DECISION_CATEGORY_C08_COMMAND_desc]
The Joint Command is established to coordinate the four major security departments: the National Security Department, the Army Department, the Air Force Department, and the Navy Department. As a military hub, it designates joint operational plans during wartime to enhance military operational efficiency and strike the enemy’s vital forces.

[zh.DECISION_CATEGORY_C08_COMMAND]
联合指挥部

[zh.DECISION_CATEGORY_C08_COMMAND_desc]
联合指挥部设立用以协调四大安全部门：国家安全部，陆军部，空军部与海军部。其作为军事枢纽机关，战时指定联合行动计划，以提升军事行动效率，打击敌人有生力量。
